  "body": "The function `console.debug()` is not present in some environments, e.g. Node.js, and according to [whatwg](https://console.spec.whatwg.org/#debug), [MSDN](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/hh696634.aspx) and [Chrome](https://developers.google.com/web/tools/chrome-devtools/console/console-reference#debug) documentation, it duplicates the functionality of `console.log()`.  Compare with the [Node console](https://nodejs.org/api/console.html) documentation which makes no mention of `debug()`.\n\nThus `console.debug()` seems to serve no useful function.  See also Microsoft/TypeScript#11751.\n",
